{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105985","id":2493656912,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Uoi9Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105985","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105985.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105985.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105985","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105985/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105985/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105985/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7be0f99f8c7986f361475fcdbc1d96c080a9fc31","number":105985,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Docs: Remove misleading comment from `Rect2`","user":{"login":"programaths","id":648709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODcwOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/648709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths","html_url":"https://github.com/programaths","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/programaths/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Removed \"Although [Rect2] itself is axis-aligned, it can be combined with [Transform2D] to represent a rotated or skewed rectangle.\" because it's misleading.\r\n\r\nWhat is being transformed are the A and B points. Resulting into a new axis aligned rectangle with the two points being transformed. It's not the rotated rectangle, but the \"bounding box\" that you obtain.\r\n\r\nYou can test if a point is in a rotated rectangle by doing the inverse transform of the point such as that the point is in same coordinate space as the rectangle.\r\n\r\n\"Check if a point is in a rotated axis aligned rectangle\" could be a tutorial.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nrect.has_point(transform.inverse()*event.position)\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gi